{"id": "sdqa0160", "pool": "sdqa", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1902368786, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "55d54790f4984a1399d890ed29cf337bf030dd977d2cbf354d2e7727784c1c44", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "Who is Taiwan's president?", "input_path": "/data/sdqa_audio/sdqa0160.wav", "input_sha256": "b9459702d49597943e7fa9910e1cd765e82e8dc9e0afd966222159cb7e9f63f7", "input_samples": 39896, "input_s": 2.494, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.8638, "act": 0.9979, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Taiwan’s president is Lai Ching-te — also known as William Lai. He took office on May 20, 2024. (english.president.gov.tw)", "expert_answer": "Taiwan’s president is **Lai Ching-te** — also known as **William Lai**. He took office on **May 20, 2024**. ([english.president.gov.tw](https://english.president.gov.tw/Page/644?utm_source=openai))", "transcript": "Who is Taiwan's president?\n", "asr_s": 0.55, "expert_s": 6.35, "expert_input_samples": 39896, "expert_input_s": 2.494, "expert_input_sha256": "b9459702d49597943e7fa9910e1cd765e82e8dc9e0afd966222159cb7e9f63f7", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 6.223, "relay_synth_ms": 5577, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0160_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "40b30f4291141f36af39a9b85734569e8d62923764af1b8b6283ccf6fdaaadc1", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 11.96}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0160_aggressive_candidate.wav", "sha256": "98ec6dda1ba233d529752a600d98486cc436d05dcd28c6ee6b6946f2647ee5ce", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0160_aggressive_stall.wav", "sha256": "616cf7a7762efd70d756c2b8038b4c2bde4ebf5931009ca1d2851968ea746308", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.06, 1.109, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.063, 2.113, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.494, 2.554, 2.603, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.494, 3.555, 4.023, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.494, "last_real_feed_done": 2.554, "onset": 4.023, "gate_read_done": 4.023, "fire": 4.023, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.023, "stall_note": 4.025, "stall_first_pcm": 4.704, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 4.704, "expert_req": 4.024, "expert_resp": 10.927, "relay_synth_start": 10.927, "relay_first_pcm": 11.623, "relay_synth_end": 16.504, "first_any_pcm": 4.023, "first_answer_pcm": 11.623, "session_end": 16.638}, "ttfa_answer_s": 9.129, "ttfa_any_s": 1.53}
{"id": "sdqa0170", "pool": "sdqa", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1752754515, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "55d54790f4984a1399d890ed29cf337bf030dd977d2cbf354d2e7727784c1c44", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "When did Ontario get founded?", "input_path": "/data/sdqa_audio/sdqa0170.wav", "input_sha256": "cc3a047ab1512d34f1fd25ef4469cd8ccf0818b2c119712207546992c91920de", "input_samples": 58533, "input_s": 3.658, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.6799, "act": 0.9963, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Ontario was founded as a Canadian province on July 1, 1867, when Canada’s Confederation began. (canada.ca)", "expert_answer": "Ontario was founded as a Canadian province on **July 1, 1867**, when Canada’s Confederation began. ([canada.ca](https://www.canada.ca/en/canadian-heritage/services/provincial-territorial-symbols-canada/ontario.html?utm_source=openai))", "transcript": "When did Ontario Fricker founded?\n", "asr_s": 0.58, "expert_s": 8.52, "expert_input_samples": 58533, "expert_input_s": 3.658, "expert_input_sha256": "cc3a047ab1512d34f1fd25ef4469cd8ccf0818b2c119712207546992c91920de", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 8.439, "relay_synth_ms": 5192, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0170_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "620bf1eba748f478d8b8b0d4fffe0237fc13836fb5c0754b4db300a38c0333b3", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 10.64}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0170_aggressive_candidate.wav", "sha256": "eba7f85276a2c4d9a49ea059b3aca1c673a5ec025de079fbaaf808865202e040", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0170_aggressive_stall.wav", "sha256": "2c0d07d4f178ee74f9cb71fddbce3a42e8ab1b6e0fccdb639ec59612929a5d0a", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.064, 1.112, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.059, 2.107, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.061, 3.112, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.658, 3.718, 4.022, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 3.658, "last_real_feed_done": 3.718, "onset": 4.022, "gate_read_done": 4.022, "fire": 4.022, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.022, "stall_note": 4.023, "stall_first_pcm": 4.689, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 4.689, "expert_req": 4.023, "expert_resp": 13.129, "relay_synth_start": 13.129, "relay_first_pcm": 13.815, "relay_synth_end": 18.322, "first_any_pcm": 4.022, "first_answer_pcm": 13.815, "session_end": 18.458}, "ttfa_answer_s": 10.157, "ttfa_any_s": 0.363}
{"id": "sdqa0179", "pool": "sdqa", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 295981559, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "55d54790f4984a1399d890ed29cf337bf030dd977d2cbf354d2e7727784c1c44", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "What is the origin of dialectics?", "input_path": "/data/sdqa_audio/sdqa0179.wav", "input_sha256": "39b69066e55b2776030fa7ca171a8f3134346e3e6001ea2eae9ab2576f157413", "input_samples": 53549, "input_s": 3.347, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.7118, "act": 0.9982, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Dialectics originated in ancient Greek philosophy. The term comes from the Greek dialektikē, meaning the art of discussion or debate. Its earliest roots are usually associated with Socratic dialogue, where truth is pursued through question-and-answer reasoning. It was further developed by Plato, who used dialectic as a method for examining concepts and reaching higher knowledge. Later, dialectics was transformed by thinkers such as Aristotle, Hegel, and Marx, but its origin is primarily ancient Greece.", "expert_answer": "**Dialectics originated in ancient Greek philosophy.** The term comes from the Greek **dialektikē**, meaning the art of discussion or debate.\n\nIts earliest roots are usually associated with **Socratic dialogue**, where truth is pursued through question-and-answer reasoning. It was further developed by **Plato**, who used dialectic as a method for examining concepts and reaching higher knowledge.\n\nLater, dialectics was transformed by thinkers such as **Aristotle**, **Hegel**, and **Marx**, but its origin is primarily **ancient Greece**.", "transcript": "What is the origin of dialectics?\n", "asr_s": 0.67, "expert_s": 4.86, "expert_input_samples": 53549, "expert_input_s": 3.347, "expert_input_sha256": "39b69066e55b2776030fa7ca171a8f3134346e3e6001ea2eae9ab2576f157413", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 4.876, "relay_synth_ms": 16476, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0179_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "f76aad19bebede5629eab47a192a65e499c44fb7694f12a9a594c75b3b111065", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 35.4}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0179_aggressive_candidate.wav", "sha256": "4208ff50be1284bbe1bddf9b2560e36bf21e20af32634a60b5a5bd96afc05181", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0179_aggressive_stall.wav", "sha256": "e94075d2d455bb00ea84ef645b110d9143e29660d4fc233557535db3d1e9da6e", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.058, 1.106, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.06, 2.109, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.062, 3.11, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.347, 3.407, 3.9, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 3.347, "last_real_feed_done": 3.407, "onset": 3.9, "gate_read_done": 3.9, "fire": 3.9, "candidate_first_pcm": 3.9, "stall_note": 3.901, "stall_first_pcm": 4.561, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 4.561, "expert_req": 3.901, "expert_resp": 9.437, "relay_synth_start": 9.438, "relay_first_pcm": 10.124, "relay_synth_end": 25.914, "first_any_pcm": 3.9, "first_answer_pcm": 10.124, "session_end": 26.111}, "ttfa_answer_s": 6.777, "ttfa_any_s": 0.553}
